      "writtenOn": "2017-04-20T02:55:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think some of these BUG_ON calls are useful. The crash you get if you trip this BUG_ON is easier to debug than that crash you get if you just remove this BUG_ON and the same condition occurs.",
      "parentUuid": "9864ac3d_55bf006b",
      "range": {
